status: 409
content-security-policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; connect-src 'self'
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Welcome — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><div class="wizard"><nav aria-label="Setup progress"><p class="docket-label">Step <span class="num">1</span> of <span class="num">3</span> · Welcome</p><ol class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5" role="list"><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done" aria-current><span class="sr-only">Welcome</span></li><li class="wizard-segment"><span class="sr-only">Get ready</span></li><li class="wizard-segment"><span class="sr-only">Tap</span></li></ol></nav><section class="wizard-panel"><p class="docket-label">Probe Beta Ltd</p><h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink"><span class="block">Hi Probe Beta Employee</span> <span class="block text-ink/70">Let's set up your phone.</span></h1></section><section class="docket wizard-panel"><p class="font-display text-base text-ink/85">Probe Beta Ltd uses Taptime to record your shifts. Each tap saves the time, your phone's IP address and, if your phone shares it, your location at that moment. Your location is never tracked between taps. No fingerprints, no face, no voice.</p></section><section class="border-l-4 border-tomato bg-paper px-4 py-4"><p class="font-display font-bold tracking-tight">This phone belongs to someone else</p><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85"><p>It is signed in as <span class="font-bold">Maria Borg — Kebab Factory Ltd</span></p><p class="mt-2">Finishing setup hands this phone to Probe Beta Employee and signs Maria Borg out of it.</p><p class="mt-2 font-bold text-ink">If you did not expect this, close the page and tell your manager. Their hours are recorded on this phone.</p></div></section><form method="post" action="/api/activate" class="wizard-actions"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="TESTcsrfTESTcsrfTESTcsrfTESTcsrfTESTcsrf123"> <label class="flex items-start gap-3 border-l-4 border-tomato bg-paper px-4 py-4"><input type="checkbox" name="switch" value="yes" required class="mt-0.5 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 accent-tomato"> <span class="text-sm text-ink/85">I understand this signs Maria Borg out of this phone.</span></label> <section class="border-l-4 border-tomato bg-paper px-4 py-4"><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Nothing was changed. Tick the box above if you really mean to take this phone over.</span></div></section><p class="text-center font-display text-sm text-ink/85">By continuing, you agree to the <a id="terms-open" href="#terms" class="hit-link terms-open">terms and privacy details.</a></p><button type="submit" name="consent" value="yes" class="tap-button">Agree and continue</button></form><section id="terms" class="terms-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="terms-title" tabindex="-1"><div class="terms-card"><div class="terms-scroll"><h2 id="terms-title" class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Terms and privacy</h2><h3 class="terms-heading">Who is responsible</h3><p class="terms-body">Probe Beta Ltd is responsible for your attendance records. Taptime processes them on its behalf.</p><h3 class="terms-heading">What is recorded</h3><p class="terms-body">The time of each tap, the venue, your phone's IP address and, if your phone shares it, your location at that moment. A cookie keeps this phone signed in, so you don't need a password. Your location is never tracked between taps. No fingerprints, no face, no voice.</p><h3 class="terms-heading">Why</h3><p class="terms-body">To record your working hours for Probe Beta Ltd.</p><p class="terms-body mt-4">For more information, visit:</p><a href="/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="terms-doc">Privacy policy</a> <a href="/legal/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="terms-doc">Terms of service</a></div><div class="terms-foot"><a href="#terms-open" class="terms-close">Close</a></div></div></section></div></main></body></html>